  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #F89009;\">방학동안 1,2강 연수를 들었는데 너무 좋은 내용의 강의라서 재과만에 올려봅니다! :) 재과만선생님들 함께해용~&#160;</span></b></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">교사성장학교와 함께하는 &lt;2024년 교사성장 프로젝트 자율연수&gt;</span></b><br>&#160;<br>“교사는&#160;무엇으로&#160;성장하는가?”<br>교사의&#160;자산,&#160;자아,&#160;글쓰기,&#160;학급,&#160;수업!<br>2024년&#160;성장하고&#160;싶은&#160;선생님들&#160;초대합니다!<br>1.&#160;일정-&#160;2024년&#160;1월~2월&#160;<br>2.&#160;장소-&#160;줌&#160;온라인&#160;연수(문자로&#160;줌&#160;주소&#160;발송)<br>3.&#160;연수&#160;대상-&#160;초&#8226;중등&#160;교사<br>4.&#160;회비-&#160;무료<br>5.&#160;강의&#160;세부&#160;일정-&#160;포스터&#160;참고<br>6.&#160;연수&#160;후기&#160;작성&#160;이벤트-&#160;스타벅스&#160;이용권((강의당&#160;10명&#160;추첨)<br>7.&#160;신청&#160;방법-&#160;<a href=\"https://naver.me/xIgi0q5Y\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://naver.me/xIgi0q5Y</a><br>8.&#160;교사성장학교&#160;오픈&#160;채팅방-&#160;<a href=\"https://open.kakao.com/o/gY6jJ81f\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://open.kakao.com/o/gY6jJ81f</a><br>9.&#160;문의:&#160;교사성장학교&#160;대표&#160;이종관(010-2292-6150)<br>10.&#160;기타:&#160;연수와&#160;관련된&#160;자세한&#160;사항은&#160;오픈&#160;채팅방에서&#160;안내합니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ccede25bbb49daf06b3a8748182d36d4467ee89b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ccede25bbb49daf06b3a8748182d36d4467ee89b\" data-origin-width=\"1019\" data-origin-height=\"1440\"></div><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/78010f910b50f3ab054d2b3d3fe6f675bb682f36\" data-origin-width=\"1019\" data-origin-height=\"1440\" style=\"width:33.33%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/78010f910b50f3ab054d2b3d3fe6f675bb682f36\" class=\"